- A little bit.

00:08:30.453 --> 00:08:31.890
But I feel like the choice
must have been good,

00:08:31.890 --> 00:08:32.723
to be honest.

00:08:32.723 --> 00:08:35.613
- One, two, three.

00:08:36.656 --> 00:08:38.380
(chime plays)

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:39.213
- Jasmine!

00:08:40.127 --> 00:08:42.540
- Oh, what was that? (chuckles)

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:43.373
How are you?

00:08:43.373 --> 00:08:44.510
- I'm good. How are you doing?

00:08:44.510 --> 00:08:46.250
- Did you expect me?

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:48.990
- Did I expect you? Low key.

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:50.240
- Low key.
- Low key.

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:52.870
Did you expect to be here?

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:55.800
- It was nervous, but maybe
the suit did something.

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.489
- [Crew Member] Mars,
I'm gonna hand you this.

00:08:57.489 --> 00:08:58.787
- Oh, that's hilarious.

00:08:58.787 --> 00:09:01.070
- [Crew Member] And I'm
gonna have you reveal

00:09:01.070 --> 00:09:03.570
who you were selecting for yourself

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:06.017
after round two and round three.

00:09:06.017 --> 00:09:08.600
- Well, for round two,

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:13.309
I had Jasmine, Elen, and Azonde.

00:09:13.309 --> 00:09:15.347
- Oh, (beep).
- Period.

00:09:15.347 --> 00:09:16.403
- For the last one,

00:09:19.262 --> 00:09:20.095
I had

00:09:23.243 --> 00:09:24.358
Jasmine.

00:09:24.358 --> 00:09:26.995
(girls clap and cheer)

00:09:26.995 --> 00:09:28.270
- Nice.
- That's funny.

00:09:28.270 --> 00:09:30.018
What are the odds?

00:09:30.018 --> 00:09:33.640
- I thought you didn't
pick me so I was like...

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:35.876
Are you gonna tell me
what your name means now?

00:09:35.876 --> 00:09:38.019
- Oh, oh, oh yeah.

00:09:38.019 --> 00:09:39.383
We can go on a date. I got you.

00:09:39.383 --> 00:09:40.867
I'll tell you. I'll tell you about it.

00:09:40.867 --> 00:09:42.521
- [Crew Member] So we think
there's a date in the future?

00:09:42.521 --> 00:09:45.050
- Yeah.
(girls clap)

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:46.662
- We're happy.

00:09:46.662 --> 00:09:48.093
- [Crew Member] Are we
all gonna be bridesmaids?

00:09:48.093 --> 00:09:48.926
- Yes!

00:09:48.926 --> 00:09:50.241
- [Kirsten] We talked about this earlier.

00:09:50.241 --> 00:09:51.632
If someone gets married...

00:09:51.632 --> 00:09:55.533
